      "sequence_position": 2,
      "problem": "Let $a=⟨2,-4,0⟩$ and $b=⟨9,7,7⟩.$ Find the vector projection of $b$ onto $a.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{a}\\,b & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{a\\cdot a}a \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}a \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cdot 9+(-4)\\cdot 7+0\\cdot 7}{{2}^{2}+(-4)^{2}+{0}^{2}}a \\\\  & =-\\frac{10}{20}⟨2,-4,0⟩ \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}⟨2,-4,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,2,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
